id=CompanionDogsPug
name=CD: Pug
description=Pugs for Companion Dogs - the house dog, and the first companion in the family whose worth is not fighting, hunting, herding or hauling. A Pug trains Obedience twice as fast as any other breed and its bond never fades on its own, so it stays reliable however long you have been gone. It spots trouble sooner than the rest and barks about it, which warns you and the dead alike, and it is the only dog stuck on Alert: no Quiet, no Silent watch. Everything else is the price: the weakest bite in the family, no kills, no knockdowns, the first to panic, no keeping up at a sprint, almost nothing carried, and real suffering in summer heat. With the Your Shadow moodle it drives off unhappiness, boredom and stress faster than any other dog, until the heat leaves it panting. Stray Pugs are common in homes and turn up at pet shops and veterinary clinics. REQUIRES the Companion Dogs mod (0.7.0 or newer). Do not remove this add-on from a save with living Pugs.
